      "stepNo": 1,
      "question": "Why did the housings fail the helium leak test?",
      "answer": "Gas pores broke through the machined sealing face, leak rate 13.8 against max 5 mbar*l/s",
      "evidenceCitation": "Inspection lot QALS/QAMR"
    },
    {
      "stepNo": 2,
      "question": "Why did the pores form only on DIE1 castings?",
      "answer": "DIE1 vacuum at shot was 190 mbar instead of below 80 mbar, so air stayed in the cavity",
      "evidenceCitation": "Shot monitoring log WC-CAST-03"
    },
    {
      "stepNo": 3,
      "question": "Why was DIE1 vacuum insufficient? (root cause)",
      "answer": "The chill vent block is clogged with release agent and vent cleaning has no PM interval",
      "evidenceCitation": "SAP PM order history WC-CAST-03"
    }
